  <item>
    <title>《33号远征队》《The Alters》：游戏里的道德选择，为什么总像一场骗局？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6355d1a3fec224d5a2ce2c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6355d1a3fec224d5a2ce2c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:15:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继续评2025年的几个热门游戏：33号远征队，The Alters 多重人生。都好玩，又都有些令人遗憾。同时进行一些主播个人喜好的安利！</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 33号远征队的弹反设计</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 大逃杀氛围</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 游戏的两个主题：如何面对死亡，我是谁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 介绍The Alters</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 游戏机制的根本问题：最优解需要预知未来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 对多重人生的批判：游戏只需要为自己的受众负责吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> Before Your Eyes：用眨眼回溯人生</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期参考阅读/观看：</span></p><h1><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_zVt0u9BR8&amp;t=1505s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_zVt0u9BR8&amp;t=1505s"><strong><span>The Award Clair Obscur Didn’t Deserve To Win</span></strong></a><strong><span> by The Architect of Games</span></strong></h1><p><strong><span>《长日将尽》 by 石黑一雄</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/14278377/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/14278377/"><strong><span>《不堪抄》</span></strong></a><strong><span> by 柳具足</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://read.douban.com/ebook/7564925/?icn=from-author-page" data-url="https://read.douban.com/ebook/7564925/?icn=from-author-page"><strong><span>《七桥会》</span></strong></a><strong><span>by 柳具足</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep25302?from_spmid=666.19.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep25302?from_spmid=666.19.0.0"><strong><span>《永生之酒》</span></strong></a></p><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eQREYpE2U?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.sections&amp;vd_source=2edfe367f54209482430cf036993a750" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eQREYpE2U?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.sections&amp;vd_source=2edfe367f54209482430cf036993a750"><strong><span>《回转企鹅罐》</span></strong></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
