  <item>
    <title>Hades和苏丹的游戏：怎么独立游戏都是 roguelike？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5a1c0ca3fec224d59f2d32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5a1c0ca3fec224d59f2d32</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 12:18:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期想聊一个有些极端、但越想越合理的结论：很多独立游戏都在不同程度上变成了 roguelike。Roguelike不只是“随机地图”+ “永久死亡”，更像一套解决重复、控制成本、持续提供新鲜感的结构工具：失败、重开、随机与局外成长，既是玩家体验，也是开发方法。动作roguelike用随机来构筑 build，Into the Breach用随机来生成谜面，而有些游戏的随机却会和叙事/道德选择打架。都是随机，为什么有时成立、有时却不行？</span></p><p><span>提到的游戏：Hades, Into the Breach, 苏丹的游戏, Wildermyth, Splatoon 3 DLC Side Order</span></p><p><span>（纠错+致歉：节目里把Into the Breach都说成2019年上线了，其实是2018年！）</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> roguelike的定义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 介绍一下著名现代roguelite：Hades</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 从随机里找确定性（build）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> 叙事策略：把“宏大叙事”降维成家庭情景剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> Hades的叙事主题：寻找真相</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> Hades II的叙事主题：改变命运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> “落地”：机制、美术、文本互相翻译彼此</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 简要介绍Into the Breach&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> Telegraphed attack：信息全摊开，随机只负责“出题”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> 负反馈问题：机甲减员/掉电后，为何更难翻盘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 开发者怎么确保一定有解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 独立开发者需要铭记：多烂的游戏，都会有人觉得好玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 所有的游戏都是roguelike：随机随机随机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 介绍：苏丹的游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 叙事roguelike的核心问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 当核心决策变成道德选择，随机不再带来新鲜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> 苏丹的游戏对照组：Wildermyth</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2883">48:03</a> 投射关系：玩家不是单一主角，选择的道德负担更小</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">48:44</a> Splatoon3 DLC Side Order</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 关卡无厘头命名：形容词×场景×规则的笛卡尔积</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3166">52:46</a> 实际的随机：固定关卡池抽取 + 芯片真随机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">56:17</a> 设计启示：随机的成本控制、可预测性与惊喜之间的交易</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/626beed725befd84321c1489/lsjBH1dBD9Vz6Q9uDEwYW85PmL_u.m4a" length="55808097" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoyZlYs4xhZS-96ZiOp-8BUO4gvx.png"/>
