  <item>
    <title>谁能不看攻略打通《动物井》？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6739fc2c43dc3a438754ca26</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6739fc2c43dc3a438754ca26</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 14:33:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播的年度游戏回顾。今年又是不玩3A的一年，趁金摇杆和TGA公布前，不带奖项高光偏见地聊下今年几个高人气独立游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也想知道大家今年都玩了什么，年度最佳和年度最烂都是什么呢？期待听众朋友们的评论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期所有音乐都来自Sayonara Wild Heart OST</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> </span></strong><span>对今年玩过游戏的整体回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">02:44</a> 夸奖Cocoon</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">8:08</a> 发行商Annapurna</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 对Sayonara Wild Heart又爱又恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 爆评Lorelei and the Laser Eyes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 简单介绍动物井</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a> 最爱的道具：妙妙圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a>谁能不看攻略打通Animal Well</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 上头Balatro</span></p><span></span><p><span>*节目里不小心把月下夜想曲说成了月下狂想曲</span></p>]]></description>
