  <item>
    <title>《恋与深空》：不需要和三次元男性发展亲密关系，是我人生的一大亮点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e03cceb46cd66550db6d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e03cceb46cd66550db6d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 09:11:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！最近玩了《恋与深空》非常上头，想和大家分享一下对这个游戏的感想和思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3D乙游是否比2D乙游更沉浸？女性玩家该如何评价它的战斗系统？我在这个游戏中感受到的快乐究竟是怎样一种情感？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的书和游戏】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fourth Wing，奇异人生 Life is Strange，Undertale，传送门 Portals，最终幻想15，异度之刃3，《爱的多重奏》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推荐视频】（请自行搜索）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Can We Make Talking as Much Fun as Shooting?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">1:04</a> 玩恋与深空的原因是读了Fourth Wing</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">4:41</a> 对《恋与深空》的初印象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">5:42</a> 变成星推的契机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">7:27</a> 简单介绍《恋与深空》的背景故事和男主</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> 被歧视的女性玩家：女人的喜好是略低一等的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 《恋与深空》设计3D战斗是对女玩家的认可？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 认为战斗 = 电子游戏，是一种浅薄的观点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 暴力不是唯一的游戏机制</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 深空做战斗系统是一个非常正确的选择</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 深空战斗系统的问题之一：自动锁敌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 问题二:闪避技能的不统一</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 问题三：技能动画和时停</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 深空设计战斗的思路还是卡牌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 战斗中最重要的资源是时间而非信息</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 问题四：男主陪伴战斗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> npc战斗的两个参考方向：ff15和异度之刃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 深空做的好的地方是战斗的外部系统：日卡月卡和芯核</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 玩家的负面评价：内容太少</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 叠纸最大的bug是不需要做满分设计也能赚钱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 深空最大的优点是人设塑造成功</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 3D乙游vs 2D乙游</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 二创是深空设计的出发点之一</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 手游更适合做系统型玩法，而不是内容型玩法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 牵绊度系统</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 排外性和社区化之间并不矛盾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 爱男主其实是在探寻自我，是一种很健康的关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 如何做陪伴式乙游</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 如何面对男主的虚拟性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 玩《恋与深空》，做幸福女人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 乙女游戏应该探索“爱”的多种形态</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj0Xqb4ek9yye2xiq0v33urjlt1G.m4a" length="73211507" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoyZlYs4xhZS-96ZiOp-8BUO4gvx.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《明日传奇》读后感：看书不如追剧，打游戏不如做游戏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6559b98ec9e7cfe025d15740</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6559b98ec9e7cfe025d15740</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 2023 07:30:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>S01 Ep04</span></p><span></span><p><span>打游戏的同时也要看书，和大家推荐一本以独立游戏为主题的小说《明日传奇》：Tomorrow, and tomorrow, and tomorrow by Gabrielle Zevin</span></p><span></span><p><span>【抽奖环节】在本期播客下留言+订阅的听众友友里按十五分之一的比例抽几本中文版《明日传奇》，截止日期到2023年12月31日。没有赞助，主播自费鼓励大家一起做读书人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">1:25</a> 故事简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">3:52</a> 《明日传奇》的两个有意思的主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">7:27</a> 什么才是独立游戏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 拉踩一下国产独立游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 作者写得好的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 电子游戏和青少年暴力：布朗诉娱乐商业协会案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 小说主旨：restart</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 游戏是一种没有产出的行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> 探讨同样主题的日剧《重启人生》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 《重启人生》中两个相互矛盾的主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 电子游戏主题小说还可以写些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> sam和sadie之间的复杂情感关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> 设计游戏是想象具体的玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 沉浸感的另一面是排他性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> 商业游戏不能做自我表达吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的游戏，书籍和电视剧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bastion，Transistor，Hades，开发商：SuperGiant</span><br><span>UnderTale，OxenFree，尼尔：机械纪元</span><br><span>Homo Ludens，《游戏的人》作者：Huizinga, Johan</span><br><span>《重启人生》主演：安藤樱</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltmxagORotQWvJixyAoEqDpfoWwq.m4a" length="42353399" type="audio/mp4"/>
