  <item>
    <title>游戏设计师们应该从《塞尔达传说》中学到什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65102fc2bbe351e616c20b60</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65102fc2bbe351e616c20b60</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Sep 2023 12:46:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>S01 Ep03</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远赶不上潮流的拖延症主播，因为塞尔达传说：王国之泪太震撼了，强迫自己录播客，从game designer的角度分析一下王国之泪的游戏设计。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a>推荐一本独立游戏制作相关的小说《明日传奇》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 回顾ns上塞尔达两作的基本情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 对王国之泪中四个新机制的分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 核心功能建造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 王国之泪对建造功能的拓展设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a> 最喜欢的几个游戏体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 为什么王国之泪也有差评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 评一评原神</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐的书籍：《心想事成的创意整理术》作者：玉树真一郎</span></p>]]></description>
